lantern-pr 1
# 38
#title Build and release a Linux x64 package
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/38
#branch feat/linux-x64-build
#base main
#opened 2026-11-12
#head b7808acdd4de87291f5a850999d5180d77d8cc0f
#describe what A tag release also publishes Lantern-linux-x64.zip, and CI builds, zips and checks the same Linux package on Ubuntu. The Linux build is x64 only and unsigned.
#describe what The docs and README gain a Linux entry: extract, chmod +x, run, and a note on the Chromium sandbox.
#describe before Releases had macOS and Windows packages only; Ubuntu CI only compiled the app.
#describe after Releases also carry Lantern-linux-x64.zip; the Ubuntu CI leg builds the package, zips it and checks its files and the RunAsNode fuse.
#describe verified Typecheck, lint and the full unit suite pass; the workflow hygiene test passes with the new job.
#describe verified The package layout was checked by packaging for Linux from a Mac; only a Linux machine can show that the app starts.
+ scripts/check-linux-package.sh
~ .github/workflows/ci.yml
~ .github/workflows/release.yml
~ CONTRIBUTING.md
~ README.md
~ docs/installation.md
~ package.json
~ scripts/fuses.js
~ scripts/package-licences.mjs
~ test/ci-workflow.test.ts
~ test/licences.test.ts
~ test/release-workflow.test.ts
~ test/updater-service.test.ts
#order package.json
#order scripts/fuses.js
#order scripts/package-licences.mjs
#order scripts/check-linux-package.sh
#order .github/workflows/release.yml
#order .github/workflows/ci.yml
#order test/updater-service.test.ts
#order test/licences.test.ts
